{"availability":"available","full":"Anish-Das-GH/SkillSailer","name":"SkillSailer","description":"A AI -powered website that serves as a comprehensive platform for job seekers and recruiters, facilitating streamlined recruitment processes. It features personalized Skill recommendations, CV Analyzer. Made using ReactJS ,Firebase, Python.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"JavaScript","stars":6,"forks":3,"created":"2024-05-14T17:17:12Z","updated":"2024-08-02T17:01:37Z","branch":"main","homepage":"https://skillsailer-binary-bosses.vercel.app","topics":["firebase","python","reactjs","skillsailer","streamlit"],"demo":"https://skillsailer-binary-bosses.vercel.app/","color":"#63362a","ink":"#f8c7a8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T16:33:38.954Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-06T16:33:38.954Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-06T16:33:38.954Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-06T16:33:38.954Z","stars":6,"forks":3}],"technologies":["React","Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Presented in HackFest 2024 / TEAM BINARY BOSSES ©","Problem Statement : In today's dynamic job market, individuals and employers face challenges in aligning skills with opportunities. Existing platforms often lack the depth to accurately assess candidates' true potential or match them with suitable roles. Job seekers struggle to find positions that utilize their full skill set, while employers encounter difficulty identifying the best-fit candidates. This gap leads to inefficiencies in hiring and career advancement. There is a critical need for a comprehensive solution that utilizes the power of Artificial Intelligence to bridge this gap,…","Team Members (Team Binary Bosses):\\ Aniket Banerjee (Leader)\\ Ankit Gandhi\\ Purujit Ghosh\\ Anish Das\\ Md Nazmus Sadat"],"features":["Resume Upload: Users upload their resumes through the web application. The resumes can be in various formats such as PDF, DOC, or DOCX.","Keyword Extraction: The uploaded resumes are processed to extract text content. Using libraries like Py2pdf, relevant keywords and skills are identified from the text.","Candidate Assessment: Extracted keywords and skills are sent to Gemini AI via API calls for candidate assessment. Gemini AI analyzes the skills and provides an assessment report.","Job Matching: The system compares the extracted skills with job descriptions given as input","Assessment Report: The results from Gemini AI, including a detailed candidate assessment, are displayed to the user through the web interface."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anish-Das-GH/SkillSailer/blob/main/readme.md","fingerprint":"6fc2fab856e8ed9bfa09233d02c3245ca615ab362f0021690f849d431ee11cca","extractedAt":"2026-10-06T16:33:39.262Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-06T16:33:39.262Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Presented in HackFest 2024 / TEAM BINARY BOSSES ©","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anish-Das-GH/SkillSailer/blob/main/readme.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Now you can Create a new account if you do not have any account or just log in.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anish-Das-GH/SkillSailer/blob/main/readme.md"}],"fingerprint":"6fc2fab856e8ed9bfa09233d02c3245ca615ab362f0021690f849d431ee11cca","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anish-Das-GH/SkillSailer/blob/main/readme.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T16:33:39.262Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2024-08-02T17:01:37Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/Anish-Das-GH/SkillSailer/blob/main/readme.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-06T16:33:39.263Z","hash":"6fc2fab856e8ed9bfa09233d02c3245ca615ab362f0021690f849d431ee11cca","originalBytes":4857,"storedBytes":4857,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["job","skills","candidate","bash","gemini","data","solution","their","upload","assessment","backend","install","recommendations","recruitment","resumes","skillsailer","api","based","comprehensive","description","employers","extracted","navigate","platform","re